rname{ln}⁡\\theta -7.8\\text{ }\\,\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\theta }-7.8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we set the derivative equal to $0$ and solve for $\\theta :$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{\\theta }-7.8 & =0 \\\\ \\frac{4}{\\theta } & =7.8 \\\\ 4 & =7.8\\text{ }\\,\\theta  \\\\ \\theta  & ≈0.513\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, for this sample, the maximum likelihood estimate of $\\theta $ is $\\overset{^}{\\,\\theta \\,}≈0.513,$ rounded to $3$ decimal places."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186527147 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186162116 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "78241be4-1db7-554c-a7ce-7532345f3f5a" :knowledge-point/title "Maximum Likelihood Estimators for Continuous Probability Distributions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18079953-7a0d-57a4-8843-c654a6bb39fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.891" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526552} {:answer/id #uuid "22e80040-d18e-5faa-af39-593a97881279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.617" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526579} {:answer/id #uuid "4d8bb5ed-e27a-5e79-a56d-335ca515db9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.581" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526661} {:answer/id #uuid "6f07d653-9ff4-5a87-a55f-d3592fa58cf3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.714" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526721} {:answer/id #uuid "d50a9899-221a-5f45-912c-5d49f82f44f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.819" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526912}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "22e80040-d18e-5faa-af39-593a97881279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.617" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526579} :answer-field/id #uuid "30f99177-a32e-55ae-845f-bfa34cf66810" :answer-field/key "sel